    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      188.09,
      195.62,
      411.5,
      208.1
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 05.30 a.m. on 16 November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      228.29,
      538.37,
      413.81
    ],
    "text": "The Depression located to the Northeast of Sri Lanka, in the Bay of Bengal, has developed into a \u2018Deep Depression\u2019. The system was located approximately 640 km northeast of Trincomalee, by 11:30 p.m. yesterday. It is highly likely that the system will continue to move away from Sri Lanka and intensify into a \u2018Cyclonic Storm\u2019 by the evening of today (November 16) over the southern and adjoining west-central Bay of Bengal, and further intensify into a \u2018Severe Cyclonic Storm\u2019 over the west-central Bay of Bengal by November 17. Prevailing showers over the island is expected to reduce from today (16). Several spells of showers will occur in the Western, Sabaragamuwa, North-western and Southern provinces and in the Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      417.59,
      538.35,
      457.37
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in the Uva province and in Ampara district after 2.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      460.67,
      502.79,
      523.99
    ],
    "text": "Mainly dry weather will prevail over the other areas of the island. The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      527.65,
      488.69,
      550.63
    ],
    "text": "Misty conditions may prevail in most parts of the island during the early morning hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
